<node id="a73333b0-cb47-4f72-afb6-af150efe48a5">
  <data key="d0">{"name":"Policy Owner Rights &amp; Beneficiary Rules","text":" as required by applicable law, will accrue from the date of death until the date of \npayment.  \nBeneficiary Designation  \nThe Beneficiary is the person or entity named in the application or most recent written \ndesignation on file with the Company. If no Beneficiary survives the Insured, the Death \nBenefit will be paid to the Policy Owner, if living, or to the Owner’s estate.\n\n===== Page 8 =====\nChange of Beneficiary \n The Policy Owner may change the Beneficiary designation at any time by submitting a \nwritten request to the Company. The change shall take effect as of the date the request is \nsigned, regardless of whether the Insured is living at the time of the Company’s receipt. \n \n \n \nPOLICYOWNER RIGHTS  \nRight to Change Beneficiary  \nThe Policyowner may change the Beneficiary at any time during the Insured’s lifetime by \nsubmitting a written request to the Company. The change will take effect as of the date the \nrequest is signed, regardless of whether the Insured is living at the time of the Company’s \nreceipt of the request.  \nRight to Assign Policy  \nThe Policyowner may assign this policy or any interest in it by submitting a written \nassignment acceptable to the Company. The Company shall not be responsible for the \nvalidity or tax consequences of any assignment. The rights of the Owner and Beneficiary will \nbe subject to the terms of the assignment.  \nRight to Cancel Policy \n The Policyowner may cancel this policy at any time by submitting a written request. Upon \ncancellation, insurance coverage will terminate and no further benefits will be payable. If the \npolicy has any unearned premiums, they will be refunded as specified under applicable law.  \nRight to Request Policy Information\n\n===== Page 9 =====\nThe Policyowner has the right to request a copy of the policy, premium payment history, \nbeneficiary designations, and any applicable riders or endorsements. The Company will \nprovide the requested information within a reasonable time, in accordance with applicable \nlaws and regulations. \n Right to Elect Settlement Options  \nThe Policyowner may elect or change the method by which the Death Benefit is paid to the \nBeneficiary, subject to approval by the Company and the terms of the settlement options \noffered. \n \n \nOPTIONAL RIDERS  \nAccelerated Death Benefit Rider  \nThis rider provides for the early payment of a portion of the Death Benefit if the Insured is \ndiagnosed with a","summary":"The document describes the rules governing beneficiary selection and changes, emphasizing that updates take effect upon signing regardless of the insured's survival status. It outlines several rights granted to the policy owner, including the ability to change beneficiaries, assign the policy, cancel coverage, access policy records, and choose settlement methods. An optional Accelerated Death Benefit Rider enables partial advance payments of the death benefit upon terminal illness diagnosis.","topics":["Beneficiary Designation","Policy Owner Rights","Death Benefit Distribution","Optional Riders"],"facts":[{"name":"Interest Accrual Post-Death","sentence":"Applicable law requires that interest will accrue from the date of death until the date of payment.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["interest accrual","death benefit timing","applicable law"],"entities":[{"name":"Insured","type":"PERSON","role":"individual covered by policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"recipient of death benefit","relational_anchors":["named in the application","most recent written designation on file"]},{"name":"Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"insurer administering policy","relational_anchors":["on file with the Company","receipt of the request","approval by the Company"]},{"name":"Policy Owner","type":"PERSON","role":"party entitled to modify policy","relational_anchors":["may change the Beneficiary","may assign this policy","may cancel this policy","may request policy information","may elect settlement options"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"amount payable upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["paid to the Policy Owner, if living","paid to the Owner’s estate","early payment of a portion"]},{"name":"Written request","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"formal instrument for changing beneficiary","relational_anchors":["submitted to the Company","take effect as of the date the request is signed"]},{"name":"Unearned premiums","type":"CONCEPT","role":"refundable portion after cancellation","relational_anchors":["if the policy has any unearned premiums","refunded as specified under applicable law"]},{"name":"Settlement options","type":"CONCEPT","role":"methods for paying death benefit","relational_anchors":["subject to approval by the Company","terms of the settlement options offered"]},{"name":"Accelerated Death Benefit Rider","type":"RIDER","role":"provides early payout on diagnosis","relational_anchors":["this rider provides for the early payment","if the Insured is diagnosed with a"]}]},{"name":"Beneficiary Identification Rule","sentence":"The Beneficiary is the person or entity named in the application or most recent written designation on file with the Company.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Beneficiary Definition","Designation On File","Policy Application"],"entities":[{"name":"Insured","type":"PERSON","role":"individual covered by policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"recipient of death benefit","relational_anchors":["named in the application","most recent written designation on file"]},{"name":"Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"insurer administering policy","relational_anchors":["on file with the Company","receipt of the request","approval by the Company"]},{"name":"Policy Owner","type":"PERSON","role":"party entitled to modify policy","relational_anchors":["may change the Beneficiary","may assign this policy","may cancel this policy","may request policy information","may elect settlement options"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"amount payable upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["paid to the Policy Owner, if living","paid to the Owner’s estate","early payment of a portion"]},{"name":"Written request","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"formal instrument for changing beneficiary","relational_anchors":["submitted to the Company","take effect as of the date the request is signed"]},{"name":"Unearned premiums","type":"CONCEPT","role":"refundable portion after cancellation","relational_anchors":["if the policy has any unearned premiums","refunded as specified under applicable law"]},{"name":"Settlement options","type":"CONCEPT","role":"methods for paying death benefit","relational_anchors":["subject to approval by the Company","terms of the settlement options offered"]},{"name":"Accelerated Death Benefit Rider","type":"RIDER","role":"provides early payout on diagnosis","relational_anchors":["this rider provides for the early payment","if the Insured is diagnosed with a"]}]},{"name":"Death Benefit Payout Priority","sentence":"If no Beneficiary survives the Insured, the Death Benefit will be paid to the Policy Owner if the Policy Owner is living.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Beneficiary Survival","Policy Owner Rights","Death Benefit Distribution"],"entities":[{"name":"Insured","type":"PERSON","role":"individual covered by policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"recipient of death benefit","relational_anchors":["named in the application","most recent written designation on file"]},{"name":"Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"insurer administering policy","relational_anchors":["on file with the Company","receipt of the request","approval by the Company"]},{"name":"Policy Owner","type":"PERSON","role":"party entitled to modify policy","relational_anchors":["may change the Beneficiary","may assign this policy","may cancel this policy","may request policy information","may elect settlement options"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"amount payable upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["paid to the Policy Owner, if living","paid to the Owner’s estate","early payment of a portion"]},{"name":"Written request","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"formal instrument for changing beneficiary","relational_anchors":["submitted to the Company","take effect as of the date the request is signed"]},{"name":"Unearned premiums","type":"CONCEPT","role":"refundable portion after cancellation","relational_anchors":["if the policy has any unearned premiums","refunded as specified under applicable law"]},{"name":"Settlement options","type":"CONCEPT","role":"methods for paying death benefit","relational_anchors":["subject to approval by the Company","terms of the settlement options offered"]},{"name":"Accelerated Death Benefit Rider","type":"RIDER","role":"provides early payout on diagnosis","relational_anchors":["this rider provides for the early payment","if the Insured is diagnosed with a"]}]},{"name":"Estate Payout Condition","sentence":"If no Beneficiary survives the Insured and the Policy Owner is not living, the Death Benefit will be paid to the Owner’s estate.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Beneficiary Designation","Death Benefit Distribution","Policy Owner Survival"],"entities":[{"name":"Insured","type":"PERSON","role":"individual covered by policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"recipient of death benefit","relational_anchors":["named in the application","most recent written designation on file"]},{"name":"Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"insurer administering policy","relational_anchors":["on file with the Company","receipt of the request","approval by the Company"]},{"name":"Policy Owner","type":"PERSON","role":"party entitled to modify policy","relational_anchors":["may change the Beneficiary","may assign this policy","may cancel this policy","may request policy information","may elect settlement options"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"amount payable upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["paid to the Policy Owner, if living","paid to the Owner’s estate","early payment of a portion"]},{"name":"Written request","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"formal instrument for changing beneficiary","relational_anchors":["submitted to the Company","take effect as of the date the request is signed"]},{"name":"Unearned premiums","type":"CONCEPT","role":"refundable portion after cancellation","relational_anchors":["if the policy has any unearned premiums","refunded as specified under applicable law"]},{"name":"Settlement options","type":"CONCEPT","role":"methods for paying death benefit","relational_anchors":["subject to approval by the Company","terms of the settlement options offered"]},{"name":"Accelerated Death Benefit Rider","type":"RIDER","role":"provides early payout on diagnosis","relational_anchors":["this rider provides for the early payment","if the Insured is diagnosed with a"]}]},{"name":"Policy Owner Changes Beneficiary","sentence":"The Policy Owner may change the Beneficiary designation at any time by submitting a written request to the Company.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Beneficiary Designation","Policy Owner Rights","Change of Beneficiary"],"entities":[{"name":"Insured","type":"PERSON","role":"individual covered by policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"recipient of death benefit","relational_anchors":["named in the application","most recent written designation on file"]},{"name":"Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"insurer administering policy","relational_anchors":["on file with the Company","receipt of the request","approval by the Company"]},{"name":"Policy Owner","type":"PERSON","role":"party entitled to modify policy","relational_anchors":["may change the Beneficiary","may assign this