<edge source="3c328b68-a332-4773-9c29-f646235f7d51" target="a81e586d-f4c9-49fe-827d-4bb85cdc14e2">
  <data key="d3">The ability to pay premiums monthly enables ongoing compliance with policy requirements, directly supporting the fulfillment of conditions under which the death benefit becomes payable.</data>
