<edge source="3c328b68-a332-4773-9c29-f646235f7d51" target="d3aeb4da-98f5-49aa-9680-88328bc6317d">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that premiums be paid in advance ensures ongoing policy validity, which is necessary for the insurer to honor its promise to pay the death benefit under the stated terms.</data>
