<edge source="4c454305-8df7-4f9a-b113-fd49d2e08142" target="8828a9e7-6ada-4747-9993-0ab39713e114">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 identifies the core components of the contract, while fact_sentence_2 specifies a key legal safeguard—after two years, the insurer cannot challenge the policy’s validity except for non-payment. This strengthens the binding nature of the agreement outlined in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
