  <data key="d3">The presence of Eleanor B. Raynor as an authorized representative may affect the validity of written contract modifications, especially given allegations of fraud linked to her position. Her status could undermine trust in documents purportedly signed per the requirements outlined in fact_sentence_1.</data>
