<edge source="ad1cb066-961b-4cae-bf88-48a316e04583" target="e6dc59e3-a8f4-4f56-940d-46199cdc1c83">
  <data key="d3">The monthly bank draft payment method ensures regular premium delivery; if missed, the policy may lapse, necessitating reinstatement by paying overdue amounts with interest.</data>
