  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 states that premiums are guaranteed for 20 years, which aligns precisely with the definition of a 20-year level term policy mentioned in fact_sentence_1. Thus, the guarantee supports and validates the characterization of the policy type.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.98</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a337b41c-27fd-4c74-8c49-2a45657cee74" target="1967adef-ed54-4a4b-82ca-b7fa88d7aeb7">
  <data key="d3">The 20-year premium guarantee is a core provision within the legal contract between the policy owner and the insurer, defining one of its central obligations.</data>
  <data key="d4">part of</data>
