  <data key="d3">Morgan L. Hughes' status as contingent beneficiary depends on the possibility of a beneficiary change being processed, which can occur even if the insured has passed away. The rule about immediate effectiveness of such changes ensures her role remains subject to administrative actions post-insured’s death.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
