  <data key="d3">Morgan L. Hughes, designated as the contingent beneficiary, would receive the Death Benefit if the primary beneficiary does not survive the insured. The Death Benefit serves as the financial payoff specified in the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
