  <data key="d3">The rule mandating written, officer-signed amendments ensures that additions like the Accelerated Death Benefit Rider are formally documented and legally binding under the policy's terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on compliance</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
