</edge>
<edge source="b1aa54d6-2e04-4f72-a8ff-fe05054ce5b3" target="5b53632e-6b25-4a1a-a6e8-a0b75be0df3a">
  <data key="d3">The inclusion of the Accelerated Death Benefit Rider is part of the policy's provisions and therefore falls under the general rule that all benefits are bound by the contract’s terms.</data>
