</edge>
<edge source="b1aa54d6-2e04-4f72-a8ff-fe05054ce5b3" target="e7abe25a-548e-4854-99a9-005d2c7abd86">
  <data key="d3">The presence of the Accelerated Death Benefit Rider enables the policyholder to access a portion of the death benefit prematurely upon meeting eligibility criteria, such as a terminal diagnosis with limited life expectancy.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables function</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b1aa54d6-2e04-4f72-a8ff-fe05054ce5b3" target="9c8ab001-f2e6-4dce-9c28-676af9b34008">
  <data key="d3">The existence of the Accelerated Death Benefit Rider enables early access to benefits, but its payout is capped at half the policy's face value, limiting the total amount available upon qualifying conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b1aa54d6-2e04-4f72-a8ff-fe05054ce5b3" target="147ebded-c5e9-4ee9-a600-a0613a4ac44b">
  <data key="d3">The presence of an accelerated death benefit rider enables early payouts under certain conditions, but this benefit is explicitly denied if the terminal illness arises from criminal activity, thereby limiting its applicability.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional restriction</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b1aa54d6-2e04-4f72-a8ff-fe05054ce5b3" target="a82e95a0-cbf0-46a4-98e6-5b9250a0719c">
  <data key="d3">The presence of an Accelerated Death Benefit Rider enables early access to policy funds when a terminal illness is confirmed with a prognosis of 12 months or less, linking the rider's functionality directly to the medical criteria specified.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
