  <data key="d3">The presence of an Accelerated Death Benefit Rider enables early access to policy funds upon diagnosis of a terminal illness, which hinges on a licensed physician certifying the insured’s life expectancy at 12 months or less.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
