  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 sets the foundational rule that all benefits are bound by policy terms; this includes the requirement in fact_sentence_2 that a terminal illness diagnosis must meet a 12-month life expectancy threshold to qualify for an accelerated benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
