  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3">
  <data key="d3">The Policy's composition, including its formal documents and addenda, establishes the legal framework through which the Owner gains full control over the policy’s contractual rights.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8">
  <data key="d3">The inclusion of the application, schedule, and other elements in the policy establishes the legal framework that governs when coverage takes effect, including the specific activation time of 12:01 A.M. Standard Time on the Effective Date.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="5ed00eb3-5246-49ea-b4ac-9973d604854e">
  <data key="d3">The policy's composition—including application, schedule, riders, and endorsements—as established in fact_sentence_1 provides the legal foundation upon which the obligation to pay premiums arises. Without this structural definition, the requirement for continuous premium payments could not be meaningfully enforced.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="67ea902a-000e-45d2-99dd-8a832a20afc4">
  <data key="d3">The inclusion of beneficiary changes within the policy's scope relies on the policy being fully formed through documented components like applications and schedules. Without a complete policy definition, the authority to alter beneficiaries would lack foundation.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d">
  <data key="d3">The inclusion of the application, schedule, riders, and endorsements in the Policy provides the official documentation required for the Owner to exercise rights such as cancellation.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="4f290f5d-0af6-4495-b93a-b82ca8a810cd">
  <data key="d3">The policy encompasses various official documents, forming the complete contractual entity. This comprehensive nature enables the policy owner to exercise control over it, including assigning it to another party.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b">
  <data key="d3">The policy comprises formal documents including applications and endorsements, forming its legal basis. When no owner is specified, the insured automatically becomes the owner, ensuring continuity of control over the policy’s administration.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b">
  <data key="d3">The inclusion of the application, schedule, riders, and endorsements forms the complete policy document, enabling the Owner’s legal right to review it during the examination period.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0">
  <data key="d3">The inclusion of the right to examine within the policy documents ensures that the policyholder has time to evaluate the coverage outlined in the policy package, reinforcing the completeness of the policy definition.</data>
  <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
