<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="25f4cee7-d9c0-44f5-9b59-9dd48a31e12d">
  <data key="d3">Knowing the insurer is Sentinel Life Assurance Company helps clarify the source of authority behind the terms governing benefits, making the applicability of those terms more concrete.</data>
  <data key="d4">authority</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.6</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company is the insurer that issues the policy, establishing the institutional context in which ownership rights are granted. This organizational identity supports the legal foundation upon which the Owner’s rights operate.</data>
  <data key="d4">contextual supports</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="a95c37fd-7aad-43df-a80d-09cc336f0ae6">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company is the entity responsible for administering the policy, including determining how the Death Benefit is applied according to its stated terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">administers</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="5e10d7d2-9369-45f7-b96c-869e9315411d">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company is the entity responsible for administering the policy, including offering reinstatement options when a policy lapses due to missed premium payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company issues the policy, under which a grace period applies after premium due date. This ensures continuity of coverage during the grace period regardless of payment timing.</data>
  <data key="d4">implies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="40c847da-d90f-459a-9872-60f7ef19fd1f">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company is the issuing insurer whose authority enables enforcement of policy clauses, including the ability to contest validity during the incontestability period.</data>
  <data key="d4">contextualizes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="6fd46389-338e-4186-b747-65809a50a1ba">
  <data key="d3">Knowing that Sentinel Life Assurance Company is the issuing insurer enables understanding of who has the legal standing to contest the policy based on material misrepresentations made during application.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64">
  <data key="d3">The identification of Sentinel Life Assurance Company as the issuer establishes the institutional party responsible for administering the policy, which helps contextualize the scope of the "Entire Contract" that includes the policy documents and related materials.</data>
  <data key="d4">contextualizes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="2916fbaf-1ddb-4b5c-b5a0-43f4f0d1cbbc">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company issues the policy based on the applicant’s representations contained within the application. This establishes the legal foundation for underwriting decisions.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="62b8f75b-d774-450e-ab8b-266f127aef37">
  <data key="d3">Knowing the insurer is Sentinel Life Assurance Company establishes the legal entity responsible for upholding policy terms. This supports the claim that only authorized representatives of Sentinel Life can enforce or interpret the policy, preventing unauthorized changes by agents.</data>
  <data key="d4">establishes authority</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="e30bcb57-7999-45fd-95ab-1d5af8b3642a">
  <data key="d3">Knowing the insurer is Sentinel Life Assurance Company provides essential context for understanding who holds the authority to authorize alterations or waivers under the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">contextual dependency</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company issues the policy, which becomes effective upon receipt of the first premium payment.</data>
  <data key="d4">issuing entity</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="5ed00eb3-5246-49ea-b4ac-9973d604854e">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company is the issuer and administrator of the policy, making it responsible for enforcing conditions like timely premium payments to maintain coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8">
  <data key="d3">The identity of the insurer, Sentinel Life Assurance Company, establishes the party responsible for providing coverage that commences at a specific time on the Effective Date.</data>
  <data key="d4">informs</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company is the entity responsible for administering the policy, lending authority to the assertion that the policy owner holds all contractual rights.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company issues the policy, establishing its authority to grant the Owner the right to examine the policy during the 20-day examination period.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0">
  <data key="d3">The insurer, Sentinel Life Assurance Company, is responsible for honoring the 20-day examination period during which the policyholder may review and cancel the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">responds to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="de0d67af-5b66-4374-8edd-cc82b199731b">
  <data key="d3">The existence of Sentinel Life Assurance Company as a policy issuer provides institutional context for the allegations against its CEO, Eleanor B. Raynor, suggesting systemic risks associated with leadership oversight.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="df9797d7-629e-4917-bc56-582d8cf4fe9d">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a standardized term life insurance policy from Sentinel Life Assurance Company provides the institutional backdrop against which a reported fraudulent act might occur, suggesting potential exploitation of policy mechanisms.</data>
  <data key="d4">contextual relevance</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="9e3cd4f3-d236-4040-a6c4-c46f3a22a611">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company issues the term life policy detailed in chunk_summary_1; Eleanor B. Raynor, its CEO and an authorized representative mentioned in chunk_summary_2, holds leadership over the organization responsible for administering such policies, potentially implicating systemic risk due to alleged fraud.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="57fafae6-d83d-473d-a0a2-e4e4d1824c40">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company, introduced as the insurer in a standard term life policy, is linked to Eleanor B. Raynor, who serves as its CEO and is implicated in alleged fraudulent activities, raising concerns about the credibility of the company's operations.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
