<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="691ac7f0-573b-4d26-abde-28f5eabaea4f">
  <data key="d3">As the sole holder of ownership rights, the Owner has the legal capacity to exercise renewal or conversion privileges specified in the contract.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="25f4cee7-d9c0-44f5-9b59-9dd48a31e12d">
  <data key="d3">As the sole holder of ownership rights, the Owner controls access to benefits, which remain contingent upon adherence to the policy’s stated terms and exclusions.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="42f4b018-315c-49b6-a097-7db245ea5c4a">
  <data key="d3">The Owner possesses full ownership rights under the policy, meaning they hold authority over its management and benefits, which directly relates to the nature of the policy itself.</data>
  <data key="d4">has rights under</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07">
  <data key="d3">As the holder of all ownership rights, the Owner controls every component included in the policy, such as the application, schedule, riders, and endorsements, thereby exercising authority over the entire contractual package.</data>
  <data key="d4">owned by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d">
  <data key="d3">The designation of the Owner as the holder of all ownership rights implies control over the policy, including decisions related to beneficiaries and premium payments, which are exercised within the framework set by the insurer, Sentinel Life Assurance Company.</data>
  <data key="d4">institutional framework</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="a95c37fd-7aad-43df-a80d-09cc336f0ae6">
  <data key="d3">The Owner holds complete control over the policy, enabling them to manage its terms; however, the actual amount paid out as the Death Benefit remains bound by the specific conditions outlined within the policy itself.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884">
  <data key="d3">The Owner has full control over the policy and ensures its continuity; during the Grace Period, the policy stays active even if a premium is late, allowing the Owner time to make up the payment without losing coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="5e10d7d2-9369-45f7-b96c-869e9315411d">
  <data key="d3">The Owner possesses full control over the policy, including the ability to act on its behalf during processes like reinstatement after lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="62b8f75b-d774-450e-ab8b-266f127aef37">
  <data key="d3">The Owner holds complete ownership rights, which are safeguarded by the rule that no agent can change or waive policy provisions, preserving the Owner’s autonomy.</data>
  <data key="d4">protects</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="e30bcb57-7999-45fd-95ab-1d5af8b3642a">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s complete ownership rights necessitate that any modification to the policy must follow official procedures, ensuring accountability and preventing unauthorized changes.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a">
  <data key="d3">The Owner possesses complete control over the policy only after meeting the condition of paying the first premium, which initiates the policy’s validity.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="5ed00eb3-5246-49ea-b4ac-9973d604854e">
  <data key="d3">As the sole holder of ownership rights, the Owner is responsible for ensuring ongoing premium payments to maintain coverage. Without timely payments, the policy may lapse despite the Owner’s legal entitlements.</data>
  <data key="d4">responsibility for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8">
  <data key="d3">The Owner's designation determines when coverage starts; since the policy's effectiveness hinges on the Owner's address and time zone, the definition of the Owner enables proper activation of coverage on the Effective Date.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 establishes that the Owner holds all ownership rights; fact sentence 2 reinforces this by specifying those rights include contractual authority, effectively expanding on the scope of ownership described earlier.</data>
  <data key="d4">explains</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="67ea902a-000e-45d2-99dd-8a832a20afc4">
  <data key="d3">Since the Owner holds all rights of ownership, they have the authority to modify key aspects of the policy, including beneficiary designations.</data>
  <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d">
  <data key="d3">Since the Owner holds all rights of ownership, they have the authority to initiate actions such as requesting cancellation of the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="4f290f5d-0af6-4495-b93a-b82ca8a810cd">
  <data key="d3">The Owner possesses complete control over the policy, including the authority to transfer it through assignment. This right stems directly from the comprehensive ownership described in the first statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b">
  <data key="d3">Since the Owner holds all rights of ownership, they inherently possess the authority to review or examine the policy during the 20-day examination period.</data>
  <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b">
  <data key="d3">The definition of the Owner establishes legal control over the policy, while the second sentence specifies what happens when no Owner is formally named—defaulting to the Insured. It ensures continuity of ownership even in absence of explicit designation.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0">
  <data key="d3">The Owner possesses complete control over the policy, including the ability to act on any contractual rights, such as exercising the 20-day examination period if applicable.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
