  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 offers a foundational definition of 'Beneficiary,' which helps interpret the specific beneficiary roles detailed in chunk_summary_1; fact_sentence_1’s guarantee of stable premiums ensures predictable financial commitment throughout the term.</data>
  <data key="d4">informs</data>
