  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="73d6a0f7-3a12-49ab-8197-b9ddcf6268d3">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a grace period allows temporary delay in premium payment while preserving coverage, which aligns with the design of level premiums by preventing lapses due to short-term delays.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="ffa8734c-36ec-49dc-aca1-efd25349e88a">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a grace period allows for delayed premium payments without losing coverage, which complements the fixed premium structure by reducing financial pressure on the policyholder throughout the guaranteed term.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhances</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="bf239f1e-143c-4033-9908-3fd3008ea579">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a grace period ensures that coverage does not terminate immediately upon failure to pay; instead, it postpones termination until the grace period expires.</data>
  <data key="d4">delayed by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="b0b717e1-fe2d-4c8b-9cf6-9744f1fe04ce">
  <data key="d3">The existence of the grace period ensures continued coverage past the premium due date, thereby delaying the automatic termination specified in the policy’s end-of-term clause.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables continuity</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="25f4cee7-d9c0-44f5-9b59-9dd48a31e12d">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a grace period—wherein the policy stays active—is itself governed by the broader terms and exclusions detailed in the policy, making it a direct consequence of the policy’s internal regulations.</data>
  <data key="d4">is part of</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="42f4b018-315c-49b6-a097-7db245ea5c4a">
  <data key="d3">The provision allowing the policy to stay in force during the Grace Period only applies because the policy has been formally defined as the contractual agreement.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07">
  <data key="d3">Even though the policy remains in force during the grace period, this temporary continuation depends on prior contractual elements like those listed in the policy’s components, ensuring continuity despite late premium payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d">
  <data key="d3">A grace period keeps the policy active even if the premium isn't paid on time, implying that the issuer—Sentinel Life Assurance Company—is responsible for administering this mechanism.</data>
  <data key="d4">enforced by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="1d0d3536-a9fe-4662-85e5-dbb9cc333be7">
  <data key="d3">The Grace Period exists to maintain coverage for the Insured, reinforcing the importance of protecting the individual whose life is insured when premium payments are late.</data>
  <data key="d4">applies to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94">
  <data key="d3">The policy remains in effect during the Grace Period, giving the Owner additional flexibility to fulfill financial obligations and preserve ownership rights without immediate lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="6c97dbd6-9f74-4d6a-8dfc-ae292108fb75">
  <data key="d3">The grace period exists to maintain the validity of the policy so that the promised death benefit remains available to the beneficiary upon the insured's passing.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="a95c37fd-7aad-43df-a80d-09cc336f0ae6">
  <data key="d3">The continuation of the policy during the Grace Period preserves its ability to pay the Death Benefit, ensuring that claims remain eligible even after delayed payment.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="f57a074b-320b-46ff-87df-0bfd1ce1e327">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a Grace Period allows temporary continuation of the policy even when the Premium has not been paid yet, providing a buffer before cancellation.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="61f37a31-547e-4c2f-8bb7-5fcbc201a22f">
  <data key="d3">Because the policy stays in force during the grace period, it allows time for the overdue premium to be paid without losing protection.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="5e10d7d2-9369-45f7-b96c-869e9315411d">
  <data key="d3">If a premium is not paid on time, the Grace Period keeps the policy active until the end of the specified window. After the Grace Period expires without payment, the policy lapses, making reinstatement necessary to restore coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a">
  <data key="d3">The Grace Period allows the policy to remain active even if the premium isn't paid by the due date, contingent upon the policy having been initially issued after receiving the first premium.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="5ed00eb3-5246-49ea-b4ac-9973d604854e">
  <data key="d3">The grace period allows the policy to remain in effect despite late payments, but ongoing coverage hinges on eventually settling outstanding premiums within the grace window.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8">
  <data key="d3">The Grace Period maintains active coverage despite delayed payments, allowing uninterrupted protection leading up to the official start of coverage on the Effective Date.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3">
  <data key="d3">The grace period ensures continuous coverage even if a premium is late, maintaining the policy’s validity temporarily. This continuity operates within the framework established by the policy owner holding full contractual authority.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="defb9349-5ec2-419c-99cf-a721b93806df">
  <data key="d3">The grace period preserves policy in-force status, ensuring eligibility for the death benefit payment upon the insured’s death, making this clause essential for triggering the obligation described in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="3aea6d6e-6546-4579-b452-cbd38accf2bf">
  <data key="d3">The grace period preserves coverage temporarily after a missed payment, preventing immediate lapse; however, if reinstatement is needed later, the policyholder must prove insurability, linking the two concepts through post-lapse recovery procedures.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="fb72e3f0-f7b4-42f1-8874-ebac56171d8b">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 establishes that coverage continues during the grace period, providing time to catch up on payments; this supports the possibility described in fact sentence 2 that the policy can later be reinstated after lapsing, assuming requirements are met.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="e15e7155-24f9-4078-bb5f-26d32c0baa61">
  <data key="d3">The grace period maintains policy effectiveness, allowing the claim process to proceed after the insured’s death; without it, the policy would have lapsed before the beneficiary could submit proof of death.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables claim</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="afe75990-53e6-4092-8595-3ddaed9d18bc">
  <data key="d3">The grace period ensures continued coverage despite delayed payment, enabling future reinstatement; however, reinstatement requires paying overdue premiums plus interest, which is assessed upon resumption of coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables reinstatement</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884" target="e6dc59e3-a8f4-4f56-940d-46199cdc1c83">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 indicates the policy stays active during the grace period, enabling time to catch up on payments; fact sentence 2 specifies that reinstatement after lapse depends on repaying overdue amounts with interest, showing continuity from grace period to reinstatement procedures.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
