  <data key="d3">The definition of the Entire Contract establishes the foundational documents that determine the validity and scope of the policy, including the schedule showing its Effective Date.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
