  <data key="d3">Any attempt to alter the rules around renewal or conversion—as specified in fact_sentence_1—must first receive express written authorization from a company officer, as stated in fact_sentence_2. Without such authorization, even if allowed by contract language, the change would not be legally binding.</data>
  <data key="d4">required by</data>
