  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e30bcb57-7999-45fd-95ab-1d5af8b3642a" target="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period allows the policyholder to review and reject the policy before any modifications take effect, providing a safeguard against unauthorized changes that require written authorization.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e30bcb57-7999-45fd-95ab-1d5af8b3642a" target="de0d67af-5b66-4374-8edd-cc82b199731b">
  <data key="d3">The requirement for written authorization by a company officer in fact_sentence_1 is directly relevant to Eleanor B. Raynor’s role as CEO, making her a potential approver for waivers or alterations under the policy.</data>
