  <data key="d3">The requirement for written authorization from a company officer (fact_sentence_1) could apply to actions taken by someone like Eleanor B. Raynor, who is designated as an authorized representative (fact_sentence_2). However, her association with fraud casts doubt on the validity of any purported authorizations she might issue.</data>
