  <data key="d3">The policy’s issuance hinges on truthful representations in the application, ensuring legitimacy. These disclosures directly inform the determination of fixed premiums, making the guarantee of level rates contingent upon accurate data submission.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
