  <data key="d3">Accurate statements in the application ensure the policy remains active until the end of the term; without them, the policy may be invalidated before termination occurs.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
