<edge source="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a" target="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64">
  <data key="d3">Payment of the first premium serves as the operative trigger for the policy’s effectiveness, contingent upon the contractual boundaries outlined in the "Entire Contract."</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a" target="62b8f75b-d774-450e-ab8b-266f127aef37">
  <data key="d3">The requirement for the first premium ensures the policy becomes active, thereby triggering the binding nature of clauses like the one prohibiting unauthorized alterations by agents.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a" target="2916fbaf-1ddb-4b5c-b5a0-43f4f0d1cbbc">
  <data key="d3">Payment of the first premium serves as a necessary condition for issuing the policy, reinforcing the requirement that applicant disclosures also be accurate and complete.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a" target="5ed00eb3-5246-49ea-b4ac-9973d604854e">
  <data key="d3">The initiation of the policy requires the first premium payment, which sets the stage for future obligations. Subsequent coverage remains active only if all later premiums are paid promptly, reinforcing the necessity of consistent financial commitment after the policy begins.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a" target="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3">
  <data key="d3">The payment of the first premium triggers the formal issuance of the policy, enabling the Policy Owner to assume full contractual rights as outlined in the agreement.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional precedence</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a" target="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8">
  <data key="d3">The payment of the first premium triggers the policy's issuance, which sets the stage for coverage to begin at the specified time on the Effective Date.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions coverage</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a" target="b8a0acec-5bad-4385-aa38-b690f03f26b5">
  <data key="d3">The payment of the first premium triggers the policy’s issuance, which sets the stage for determining its Effective Date. The Effective Date, documented in the Schedule of Benefits, reflects when coverage officially starts, contingent upon the initial premium being received.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a" target="4f290f5d-0af6-4495-b93a-b82ca8a810cd">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that the policy be issued upon receipt of the first premium ensures contractual validity, enabling the policyowner to exercise rights such as assignment once the policy is active.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a" target="67ea902a-000e-45d2-99dd-8a832a20afc4">
  <data key="d3">The requirement for the first premium ensures the policy becomes effective, enabling subsequent actions like changing beneficiaries. Without the initial payment, the policy would not exist, making beneficiary changes impossible.</data>
  <data key="d4">preconditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a" target="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b">
  <data key="d3">The policy's issuance hinges on the first premium payment, which triggers the start of the 20-day examination window during which the Owner may review the policy before finalizing commitment.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
