<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="5ed00eb3-5246-49ea-b4ac-9973d604854e">
  <data key="d3">Coverage does not begin until the specified effective date; therefore, any obligations related to continuing coverage through premium payments arise only after this initial activation.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="b8a0acec-5bad-4385-aa38-b690f03f26b5">
  <data key="d3">Coverage commences at 12:01 A.M. Standard Time on the Effective Date, meaning the start time is contingent upon the effective date specified in the Schedule of Benefits.</data>
  <data key="d4">sets timing for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3">
  <data key="d3">Coverage beginning at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date marks the moment the Owner gains enforceable rights under the policy, ensuring alignment between the start of protection and the assumption of ownership privileges.</data>
  <data key="d4">coincides with</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="4f290f5d-0af6-4495-b93a-b82ca8a810cd">
  <data key="d3">Coverage initiation at the specified time enables the Owner to exercise control over the policy, including assigning it. The start of coverage marks the point at which ownership rights become actionable.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="67ea902a-000e-45d2-99dd-8a832a20afc4">
  <data key="d3">Coverage activation occurs precisely at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date at the Owner’s address, establishing the timeline during which the Owner gains full entitlements under the policy, including the power to designate or alter beneficiaries.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d">
  <data key="d3">Coverage activation occurs precisely at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date, establishing the timeline during which the Policy Owner gains full control over the policy, including the right to initiate cancellation.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b">
  <data key="d3">Coverage initiation depends on the Owner having had sufficient opportunity to review the policy beforehand. The 20-day examination period ensures the Owner can evaluate the policy terms before coverage starts.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0">
  <data key="d3">Coverage commencement occurs precisely at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date, marking the point when protection takes effect. This follows within the broader context of a 20-day examination period during which the policyholder may review and potentially cancel the policy after receiving it.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
