  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="20cc386d-205e-4dde-9202-10ead16f4e11">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="541d99fd-9b6f-4f31-9cf4-9a62e3621538">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="49372d91-674a-48db-b085-d5c8dafe7461">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="89bbb71e-be07-45a0-bc6b-59f8bfccc166">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="9da2f3b6-8f69-41a5-956a-80ba356c1c36">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="2c36b247-af70-48e9-87c9-ad36bdadce54">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="9617b84a-5728-4558-900c-b3fc5a07e5e8">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="73d6a0f7-3a12-49ab-8197-b9ddcf6268d3">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s right to cancel enables them to exit the agreement at any point, potentially motivated by factors including the ongoing commitment required by fixed premiums.</data>
  <data key="d4">considered in</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="ffa8734c-36ec-49dc-aca1-efd25349e88a">
  <data key="d3">The policyholder’s right to cancel provides autonomy over policy retention. Knowing premiums won’t rise enhances the practical significance of this right by reducing risk associated with long-term commitments.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhances</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="b0b717e1-fe2d-4c8b-9cf6-9744f1fe04ce">
  <data key="d3">The option to cancel allows the owner to end coverage before the term concludes, thereby avoiding continuation beyond the intended duration, even though the default endpoint is at the end of the term.</data>
  <data key="d4">preempts</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="42f4b018-315c-49b6-a097-7db245ea5c4a">
  <data key="d3">The Policy Owner’s right to request cancellation implies the existence of a formalized policy entity, reinforcing the need for a precise definition of what constitutes the Policy itself.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07">
  <data key="d3">The Policy Owner’s right to request cancellation implies the need for a formally documented Policy containing all relevant components, including applications and schedules.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94">
  <data key="d3">The right to request cancellation is a manifestation of the Owner’s comprehensive control over the policy, stemming directly from their full ownership status.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="a95c37fd-7aad-43df-a80d-09cc336f0ae6">
  <data key="d3">The Policy Owner may cancel the policy at any time during the term, thereby preventing the Death Benefit from becoming payable upon death.</data>
  <data key="d4">terminates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="f57a074b-320b-46ff-87df-0bfd1ce1e327">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s power to terminate the policy means they can cease making premium payments at any time during the term.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="5e10d7d2-9369-45f7-b96c-869e9315411d">
  <data key="d3">If the policy owner requests cancellation, the policy cannot be reinstated afterward, making reinstatement impossible once cancellation occurs. This highlights the finality of cancellation relative to reinstatement efforts.</data>
  <data key="d4">prevents</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64">
  <data key="d3">The Policy Owner’s right to request cancellation relies on knowing exactly what documents make up the contract; thus, the concept of the Entire Contract enables meaningful exercise of cancellation rights.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="62b8f75b-d774-450e-ab8b-266f127aef37">
  <data key="d3">The policyowner’s ability to initiate cancellation is meaningful only if the policy terms remain intact; thus, the right to cancel presupposes that no one—including agents—can override those terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">enforces condition</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="5ed00eb3-5246-49ea-b4ac-9973d604854e">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s right to cancel allows them to end coverage at any time, even if premiums have been paid regularly and coverage would otherwise continue.</data>
  <data key="d4">preempts</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="b8a0acec-5bad-4385-aa38-b690f03f26b5">
  <data key="d3">The policyowner’s right to request cancellation implies that they have control over the policy once it is issued and effective, meaning the effective date must precede any potential cancellation action.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8">
  <data key="d3">The Policy Owner’s right to request cancellation applies once coverage begins, meaning it takes effect after the specified commencement time of 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3">
  <data key="d3">The right to request cancellation is a manifestation of the Policy Owner's comprehensive ownership and control over the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">implied by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="67ea902a-000e-45d2-99dd-8a832a20afc4">
  <data key="d3">The right to request cancellation implies ultimate control over the policy, reinforcing that the owner retains the power to modify key elements like beneficiaries prior to termination.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="4f290f5d-0af6-4495-b93a-b82ca8a810cd">
  <data key="d3">The Policy Owner's right to request cancellation underscores their decision-making authority, which aligns with their capacity to assign the policy, reinforcing full ownership rights.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b">
  <data key="d3">The right to cancel the policy depends on having previously exercised the option to examine it, ensuring informed consent before termination.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0">
  <data key="d3">The Policy Owner's right to request cancellation is contingent upon exercising it within the 20-day examination period established after receiving the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b">
  <data key="d3">The ability of the Policy Owner to request cancellation depends on who holds ownership; if no Owner is designated, the Insured automatically assumes that role and thereby acquires the right to cancel.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="1c097ac1-210c-471f-87e7-62f4f7ca9887">
  <data key="d3">The right to cancel the policy complements the owner’s ability to change the beneficiary, as both reflect broad discretionary powers retained by the Policy Owner over policy administration and designations.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="6903f2e1-fcf8-476e-af64-83ccd3093b64">
  <data key="d3">The right to cancel the policy complements the owner’s control over beneficiary designations, reinforcing overall ownership autonomy. While cancellation terminates coverage, changing beneficiaries modifies payout instructions without affecting policy validity.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="4f081890-55f2-4345-893f-c638987334c2">
  <data key="d3">The right to cancel the policy complements the ability to change the beneficiary, as both reflect the Policy Owner’s broad administrative control over the policy’s lifecycle and distribution outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="f0a5245e-9eeb-422b-b2ca-4304e824a7be">
  <data key="d3">The right to cancel the policy reinforces the policy owner’s authority over major decisions, consistent with their ability to change beneficiaries independently. Both actions reflect unilateral decision-making power under the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">complementary rights</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="40cbb338-dde2-44ee-9830-c0c26916330c">
  <data key="d3">The right to cancel the policy complements the owner’s ability to assign it, as both reflect core ownership powers allowing control over the policy’s lifecycle and transfer.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="f36a1664-7f6f-4d19-a228-86f3f28f271d">
  <data key="d3">Fact Sentence 1 establishes the Policy Owner’s right to cancel; Fact Sentence 2 elaborates on how this right can be exercised through a written request at any time, providing procedural clarity.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="ea7568f9-97e8-481c-ba9d-673126fb9ca4">
  <data key="d3">The right to cancel the policy reinforces the Policy Owner’s overarching control, which also includes changing beneficiaries independently of the insured’s status. This supports the idea that ownership entails broad administrative powers over policy decisions.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36">
  <data key="d3">The right to request cancellation is supported by the ability to review premium payment history, which helps assess financial obligations before terminating coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7">
  <data key="d3">The right to request cancellation complements the right to obtain a policy copy, as having access to the policy documentation enables the owner to make informed decisions about termination.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="9a4ee5a5-54a6-4cfd-82d7-4f61d67a4610">
  <data key="d3">The right to cancel the policy complements the owner’s authority to manage beneficiary designations, as both reflect core aspects of ownership control over the policy’s lifecycle and distribution outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d" target="70b7c267-94b3-4ca2-8b53-0f47120d88f4">
  <data key="d3">The right to cancel the policy complements the owner’s ability to add riders, as both reflect the owner’s control over policy scope and duration. Cancellation allows withdrawal from coverage entirely, whereas adding riders enhances benefits without terminating the base policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="58a1f434-89e3-48b6-8ba8-3e678dc074ed" target="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">has right to cancel</data>
</edge>
