  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">person</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="ac1a3155-30c4-47e3-8009-5ab31d2e8594">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">person</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="2cc2aa6e-7081-4ac5-841b-49ea656f30d2">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">person</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="9701d0e3-975c-4210-9aca-d892b4b2fe20">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="626bf8dd-a1a3-42b8-b239-91b5d14fb634">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="b035d03f-8523-45d4-a72f-bce290606fd9">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="da7220f0-5b68-4a54-9024-a5335e5e9569">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="1d3107de-ba49-4598-8ef0-8f6e3f287fcc">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="25ff1fd5-51eb-491a-b104-b754dbf7a5d9">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="9418d0ba-555b-4c5d-8441-26ea7281f9e4">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="7c6ce27d-e32c-4a26-b756-56ccd18b4857">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="9e05a432-8c35-4f12-a21c-ca5eb3fe94e1">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="25f4cee7-d9c0-44f5-9b59-9dd48a31e12d">
  <data key="d3">Ownership defaults to the Insured when unassigned, ensuring someone has legal standing to act on behalf of the policy’s beneficiaries, even though final benefit disbursement remains bound by policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables control</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="42f4b018-315c-49b6-a097-7db245ea5c4a">
  <data key="d3">When no Owner is specified, the Insured defaults to owning the policy—a provision only meaningful within the context of defining what constitutes a "Policy." Therefore, this rule presupposes the prior establishment of the policy's identity.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07">
  <data key="d3">When the insured is also the owner—defaulted if unassigned—their authority stems from the comprehensive nature of the policy, which includes binding elements like applications and endorsements.</data>
  <data key="d4">defined by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="1d0d3536-a9fe-4662-85e5-dbb9cc333be7">
  <data key="d3">The default ownership rule relies on the identity of the Insured; thus, defining the Insured makes the ownership condition actionable and complete.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94">
  <data key="d3">When no Owner is named, the Insured assumes ownership rights; thus, the second statement logically extends or conditions the scope of the first by defining a default case for ownership assignment.</data>
  <data key="d4">fallback to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="a95c37fd-7aad-43df-a80d-09cc336f0ae6">
  <data key="d3">When the Insured is automatically considered the Owner due to lack of designation, they assume responsibility for decisions related to the Death Benefit under the policy’s governing terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64">
  <data key="d3">When no Owner is designated, the Insured automatically assumes ownership—this rule operates within the scope of the Entire Contract, ensuring consistent interpretation across policy components.</data>
  <data key="d4">defined by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="2916fbaf-1ddb-4b5c-b5a0-43f4f0d1cbbc">
  <data key="d3">When no owner is designated, the insured automatically becomes the owner, which affects how application statements are interpreted regarding authority and responsibility during underwriting.</data>
  <data key="d4">implied consequence</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3">
  <data key="d3">When no Owner is named, the Insured inherits ownership and thereby gains all contractual rights associated with the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">implies rights</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="67ea902a-000e-45d2-99dd-8a832a20afc4">
  <data key="d3">When no Owner is specified, the Insured becomes the Owner, thereby gaining control over key policy decisions including changing beneficiaries.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="4f290f5d-0af6-4495-b93a-b82ca8a810cd">
  <data key="d3">When no Owner is named, the Insured becomes the Owner, thereby gaining the legal capacity to assign the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d">
  <data key="d3">When the Insured is not formally named as Owner, they legally assume ownership status, granting them the authority to initiate cancellation under the policy’s terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b">
  <data key="d3">If no Owner is named, the Insured automatically becomes the Owner, thereby gaining the legal standing necessary to exercise the right to examine the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1b084077-c9dc-4886-b79d-a9b88b22163f" target="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">is default owner when no owner named</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="de2b11d0-76c4-4e4d-ab81-867c95d89480">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">organization</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="e7f79c51-971c-4e72-9b2e-d6b19f9f3cc8">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">person</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="af242c28-093a-4b30-b9cc-aa8f1e332f09">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">person</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="bbd9118b-1918-4d28-89e9-054ca88cf003">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">person</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="2c0030ce-18bb-412b-8194-926bb1b268f5">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="48715d73-9e87-4d90-b1f3-68462be19995">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="8bcf9835-da2d-44f1-ad1f-b49bc1e101ee">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="394262bd-fa36-4159-8f14-fd8cc5e0e5e2">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="7eb302f0-67db-4aab-b305-a2fcdfe3a4a6">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="8dff110c-660f-4f64-9cdf-459897fb7d50">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="f07b2890-ed75-4f8e-bddf-2349828e37ea">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="6c526b4b-651f-4a2c-b4ad-6035366bf0bd">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="ab52511f-23c9-45d3-94de-8981f1813b12">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="691ac7f0-573b-4d26-abde-28f5eabaea4f">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy provides them with an opportunity to understand its terms—including renewal and conversion clauses—before making any decisions.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="25f4cee7-d9c0-44f5-9b59-9dd48a31e12d">
  <data key="d3">Because benefits depend on adherence to policy terms, the Owner’s right to examine the policy allows them to confirm the validity and scope of those terms prior to commitment.</data>
  <data key="d4">precondition</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="42f4b018-315c-49b6-a097-7db245ea5c4a">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy implies they need to know what the policy is; thus, defining the policy's identity supports the legitimacy of this right.</data>
  <data key="d4">defined by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07">
  <data key="d3">The Owner's right to examine the policy implies that the policy must exist as a documented entity composed of multiple parts, including the application, schedule, riders, and endorsements.</data>
  <data key="d4">required by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy implies that the issuing company, Sentinel Life Assurance Company, must provide access to the policy documents within the specified timeframe.</data>
  <data key="d4">implied by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="1d0d3536-a9fe-4662-85e5-dbb9cc333be7">
  <data key="d3">The Owner possesses the right to examine the policy, which includes reviewing its coverage on the Insured—the person whose life is protected by the agreement.</data>
  <data key="d4">related to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94">
  <data key="d3">The right to examine the policy confirms the Owner’s control over the document, reinforcing their role as the legal holder of all ownership rights.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="6c97dbd6-9f74-4d6a-8dfc-ae292108fb75">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy allows them to verify critical elements such as the Death Benefit prior to finalizing coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="a95c37fd-7aad-43df-a80d-09cc336f0ae6">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy ensures they can assess key elements like the Death Benefit before finalizing acceptance, allowing informed decision-making about coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">informs</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="f57a074b-320b-46ff-87df-0bfd1ce1e327">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy enables evaluation of its financial obligations, including premium requirements, before agreeing to maintain it through payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">informs</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="5e10d7d2-9369-45f7-b96c-869e9315411d">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy provides them with time to assess its terms before committing, potentially leading to decisions about reinstating a previously lapsed policy if needed.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="6fd46389-338e-4186-b747-65809a50a1ba">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy enables them to assess its contents, including identifying possible material misrepresentations that could trigger the company’s right to contest the policy after issuance.</data>
  <data key="d4">prevents</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64">
  <data key="d3">The Owner's right to examine the policy implies access to one component of the Entire Contract, reinforcing the importance of the contract's composition as outlined in the prior statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">part of</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="62b8f75b-d774-450e-ab8b-266f127aef37">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy relies on the assurance that no one—including agents—can override or nullify this right through unauthorized modifications.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="2916fbaf-1ddb-4b5c-b5a0-43f4f0d1cbbc">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy supports their capacity to assess whether the stated conditions align with the application, thereby validating the foundation upon which the policy was issued.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy exists only after the policy is formally issued, which requires the payment of the first premium as stated in the prior fact.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="5ed00eb3-5246-49ea-b4ac-9973d604854e">
  <data key="d3">The Owner's ability to examine the policy provides transparency into its conditions, including premium requirements, thereby supporting compliance with the obligation to pay premiums regularly.</data>
  <data key="d4">informs</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="b8a0acec-5bad-4385-aa38-b690f03f26b5">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy ensures they can assess its terms prior to the effective date, meaning the effective date marks the deadline by which any cancellation or decision must occur.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy enables informed consent prior to coverage becoming effective, ensuring they understand obligations and benefits before protection commences.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3">
  <data key="d3">The right to examine the policy stems from the Owner’s comprehensive control over the policy, including full ownership rights established by the contract.</data>
  <data key="d4">derives from</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="67ea902a-000e-45d2-99dd-8a832a20afc4">
  <data key="d3">The opportunity to examine the policy enables the owner to understand its terms, including their authority to modify beneficiaries accordingly.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="4f290f5d-0af6-4495-b93a-b82ca8a810cd">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy supports potential future actions like assignment, providing necessary information prior to exercising that right.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d">
  <data key="d3">The opportunity to examine the policy enables the owner to evaluate its terms, including potential risks or benefits that may inform a future cancellation decision.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b">
  <data key="d3">The right to examine the policy is granted exclusively to the Owner; therefore, the designation or assumption of ownership through the absence of a named Owner ensures access to this privilege.</data>
  <data key="d4">required by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0">
  <data key="d3">The Owner's right to examine the policy is limited to a 20-day window beginning upon receipt, ensuring timely review before commitment.</data>
  <data key="d4">time limits right</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="1c097ac1-210c-471f-87e7-62f4f7ca9887">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy ensures awareness of its terms prior to acceptance, enabling informed decisions about future actions like changing the Beneficiary.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="6903f2e1-fcf8-476e-af64-83ccd3093b64">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy ensures awareness before committing, enabling informed decisions about beneficiary designations that take effect upon signing.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="4f081890-55f2-4345-893f-c638987334c2">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy ensures awareness of its terms, enabling them to make informed decisions about changing beneficiaries without relying on assumptions about the Insured’s condition at the time of submission.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="f0a5245e-9eeb-422b-b2ca-4304e824a7be">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy ensures awareness necessary to make informed decisions about beneficiary changes, supporting transparency prior to action.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables action</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="40cbb338-dde2-44ee-9830-c0c26916330c">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy ensures they can review its contents prior to making binding decisions, enabling them to fully understand the implications before choosing to assign it.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="ea7568f9-97e8-481c-ba9d-673126fb9ca4">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy ensures awareness prior to commitment, enabling informed decisions about future actions like changing beneficiaries, which can occur independently of the Insured’s condition once initiated.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="f36a1664-7f6f-4d19-a228-86f3f28f271d">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy ensures awareness prior to committing, enabling informed decisions about whether to proceed; this autonomy directly supports the later ability to cancel the policy at any time without penalty.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7">
  <data key="d3">The right to examine the policy is strengthened by the ability to request a copy, ensuring the owner can review its contents thoroughly before commitment.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="9a4ee5a5-54a6-4cfd-82d7-4f61d67a4610">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy supports informed decision-making regarding beneficiary designations, ensuring transparency before finalizing changes.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36">
  <data key="d3">The right to examine the policy supports the owner’s ability to review detailed records, including premium payment history, ensuring transparency and informed decision-making regarding policy management.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="70b7c267-94b3-4ca2-8b53-0f47120d88f4">
  <data key="d3">The right to examine the policy allows the owner to review its terms before commitment, enabling informed decisions about requesting supplementary benefits like riders. This foundational right supports the subsequent authority to customize the policy through add-ons.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
