  <data key="d3">From chunk 2's perspective, chunk 1 serves as a concrete example illustrating how generic policy provisions—including beneficiaries, riders, and expiration—are applied in practice.</data>
  <data key="d4">contextual relation</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
