<edge source="324c5044-39d6-4b2d-8c5f-04ae005f768c" target="ae44a78d-98ba-4a82-92fb-b9378124227b">
  <data key="d3">Chunk 2 expands on the grace period and reinstatement clauses mentioned in chunk 1 by specifying timing, payment modes, and documentation required, reinforcing the policyholder’s responsibilities and recovery options.</data>
  <data key="d4">elaborates on</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
