  <data key="d3">From chunk 1’s perspective, chunk 2 extends the concept of ownership by clarifying actionable rights—such as changing beneficiaries and assigning policies—that build directly on the owner’s legal standing established in the first summary.</data>
  <data key="d4">elaborates on</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
