<edge source="d31837ea-1599-48d9-acef-f6708a189681" target="b12e9b16-bbb5-4f46-b60c-3a7549f861c6">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a 20-day cancellation window implies that whoever holds ownership—the insured by default—is entitled to it, reinforcing the importance of the initial ownership designation.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d31837ea-1599-48d9-acef-f6708a189681" target="b2835f9b-be1f-42a0-910e-c6e995ace28d">
  <data key="d3">The ability to return the policy within 20 days stems from the owner’s statutory right to examine it for that duration, ensuring informed consent before commitment.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d31837ea-1599-48d9-acef-f6708a189681" target="65938361-ed69-4ef2-88b7-4494b82bd742">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s decision to return the policy within the examination period triggers immediate termination of the contract from the beginning date.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d31837ea-1599-48d9-acef-f6708a189681" target="69580977-8680-4303-b27e-16864466b8e8">
  <data key="d3">If the owner is dissatisfied with the policy within 20 days, they have the right to return it, leading to a full refund of premiums paid by the company.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d31837ea-1599-48d9-acef-f6708a189681" target="12ebf888-5542-48cf-a3ae-6bbbc3b648b6">
  <data key="d3">If the owner returns the policy within 20 days due to dissatisfaction, it is legally voided and considered never issued by the insurer.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d31837ea-1599-48d9-acef-f6708a189681" target="cca9f6cf-6067-42df-94ad-2563bd3117d4">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination right allows the owner to return the policy without penalty, but any subsequent modifications must still follow formal procedures enforced by authorized agents, ensuring consistency and compliance.</data>
  <data key="d4">enforces</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d31837ea-1599-48d9-acef-f6708a189681" target="9f637f68-638b-4eec-9c72-453a879fc0d8">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day right to cancel relies on formal procedures being followed, which are upheld by restricting waiver powers solely to official representatives.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
