  <data key="d3">The suicide clause operates independently yet contextually alongside the incontestability rule, ensuring that even though policies become incontestable after two years, suicide-related deaths still trigger restricted benefit terms during the initial period.</data>
  <data key="d4">limits</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
