  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes the general rule that suicide within two years results in a refund of premiums. Fact_sentence_2 refines this by specifying that the refund is made without interest, adding precision to the original statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
