  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes the baseline limitation on liability for suicide within two years: only returned premiums apply. Fact_sentence_2 adds that even this amount may be further diminished by any debts owed to the insurer, refining the financial outcome.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
