<edge source="f1888ece-7434-4b7e-aebc-5434189a9e7a" target="2da9f77a-5318-41fa-9bdb-52b9728b043d">
  <data key="d3">When the insured's age is incorrectly stated, the policy adjusts the death benefit proportionally to what could have been bought at the correct age; this correction process requires proper documentation and validation, consistent with the need for authorized signatures per company policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f1888ece-7434-4b7e-aebc-5434189a9e7a" target="cca9f6cf-6067-42df-94ad-2563bd3117d4">
  <data key="d3">Adjustments for misstated age necessitate formal policy changes, reinforcing why only authorized officials can make alterations to prevent misuse or error.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f1888ece-7434-4b7e-aebc-5434189a9e7a" target="9f637f68-638b-4eec-9c72-453a879fc0d8">
  <data key="d3">Adjustments for misstated age rely on established policy mechanisms, reinforcing why unauthorized waivers by agents are disallowed.</data>
  <data key="d4">required by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f1888ece-7434-4b7e-aebc-5434189a9e7a" target="8828a9e7-6ada-4747-9993-0ab39713e114">
  <data key="d3">Adjustments to coverage based on corrected age information rely on the existence of clear policy rules, which are reinforced by the incontestability clause ensuring those rules remain enforceable once the policy matures beyond the initial two-year period.</data>
  <data key="d4">precondition</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f1888ece-7434-4b7e-aebc-5434189a9e7a" target="35b294dc-e18b-451a-85f0-043e5a2acc08">
  <data key="d3">When age is incorrectly stated, the insurer recalculates coverage using proper actuarial rates, avoiding policy invalidation unless fraud or intentional deception is proven during the contestable period.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
