<edge source="52a31aaf-1af7-416b-8b31-a19b2a5a1510" target="9f637f68-638b-4eec-9c72-453a879fc0d8">
  <data key="d3">Correcting a misstated gender triggers a benefit adjustment, reinforcing the need for formal approval processes—ensuring such changes follow proper channels rather than being altered by unqualified agents.</data>
  <data key="d4">enforced by</data>
