  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 specifies that the policy lapses at the time of the unpaid premium’s due date if not paid during the grace period; fact_sentence_2 confirms this result succinctly, reinforcing the same condition and outcome.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
