  <data key="d3">Failure to pay a premium during the grace period results in loss of coverage, underscoring why only authorized personnel may alter policy terms to prevent arbitrary changes affecting such critical conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
