  <data key="d3">Reinstatement eligibility up to five years after lapse provides a recovery path for policies that have expired due to missed payments. This depends on fulfilling requirements like proof of insurability and paying overdue amounts.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
