  <data key="d3">Providing evidence of insurability allows for policy reinstatement, but this process cannot occur if the original policy was invalidated by material misrepresentation discovered within two years of issuance.</data>
  <data key="d4">exempted by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
