  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy requires demonstrating insurability to the insurer’s satisfaction, which becomes necessary when a premium isn’t paid within the initial 31-day grace period allowed under the policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows from</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
