<edge source="e6dc59e3-a8f4-4f56-940d-46199cdc1c83" target="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b">
  <data key="d3">Reinstatement involves paying overdue premiums with interest, which could have been avoided if an Automatic Premium Loan had been activated to cover those payments during the grace period.</data>
  <data key="d4">avoids need for</data>
