  <data key="d3">If premiums remain unchanged during the term, missing one may lead to lapse, but reinstatement remains feasible through repayment of arrears with interest, preserving the original guarantee.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables recovery</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
