<edge source="e6dc59e3-a8f4-4f56-940d-46199cdc1c83" target="61f37a31-547e-4c2f-8bb7-5fcbc201a22f">
  <data key="d3">Reinstatement depends on having previously exhausted the grace period, meaning the existence of a grace period makes reinstatement a viable recovery option after late payment.</data>
