  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 outlines the requirements for restoring a lapsed policy, including repayment of past-due premiums with interest, which presupposes the existence of a grace period (as mentioned in fact sentence 1) during which the policy remains in force before lapsing occurs.</data>
