<edge source="ae290ac1-57d5-418a-aeff-3020cd16c2e5" target="18dba2f2-8e4f-4bcc-9c25-79f3830d6409">
  <data key="d3">Paying premiums semi-annually establishes a regular payment obligation that must be met; failure to do so within the grace period leads to policy lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
