<edge source="ae290ac1-57d5-418a-aeff-3020cd16c2e5" target="b160aaee-2bb3-42d4-99f1-e1274612ebc3">
  <data key="d3">Paying premiums on a semi-annual basis is one of the available modes; failure to maintain such payments leads to policy lapse, resulting in termination of coverage without value.</data>
  <data key="d4">contributes to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
