  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">organization</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="41da1d70-0b28-4382-8c00-913229c760ba">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">person</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="1f0f271c-0e1b-44d6-a217-c980444fd1cf">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">person</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="9d3eb64e-d898-427b-b994-80063415402a">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">person</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="894ad489-aeee-4a40-80da-55fe5e5fb864">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="bb81706e-ebc8-4ec9-a8b7-f0387bfcb828">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">date</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="ce179d6f-9d6b-4e4a-99b9-58de296e48b2">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="a5e7e82d-3327-4afe-85bc-d39c286b9bfe">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="98962a5a-846f-4c70-89eb-5228ab922761">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="98c3e555-6592-495a-a8d1-20be90914806">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="e1f001e0-1cec-417f-a072-0c27209ace81">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">document</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="65a43e84-d268-46ce-900c-06f4538f2516">
  <data key="d3">The Policy Owner’s ability to request a change in payment method relies on having access to accurate information from the Schedule of Benefits regarding existing terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="d3aeb4da-98f5-49aa-9680-88328bc6317d">
  <data key="d3">While the rule that premiums are payable in advance defines the core obligation, it allows room for variation through the policyowner’s ability to adjust the payment method, maintaining compliance with the advance-payment principle.</data>
  <data key="d4">allowed by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="a81e586d-f4c9-49fe-827d-4bb85cdc14e2">
  <data key="d3">A policyowner’s right to alter the premium payment method implies they can choose any eligible frequency, such as monthly, supporting the feasibility of monthly payments described in the prior statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">is part of</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="06c6864a-8a1b-46ee-bb2f-99522c008d8a">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s authority to alter the payment method enables them to choose quarterly payments, making fact_sentence_1 a potential outcome of the flexibility granted in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">example of</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="ae290ac1-57d5-418a-aeff-3020cd16c2e5">
  <data key="d3">A policy owner who wishes to switch to semi-annual premium payments can do so through a formal request to modify the payment method, aligning with the allowed payment schedules.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="fc47d11a-7ce2-4140-9e5d-84adfba6efd3">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s right to alter the payment method includes selecting annual billing, making it a permissible choice under the flexible payment system.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="67535076-c012-4f51-9fca-3da547334acf">
  <data key="d3">The capacity to request a change in the premium payment method depends on having previously elected a mode. Without an initial selection, modification would not be applicable.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="2fe7c477-3ff3-4964-8334-5bce147c512e">
  <data key="d3">A policy owner may initiate a change in premium payment method, which triggers the need for the insurer to review and approve the new selection.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="d0a3204c-79af-4db3-91c3-0206bb2cd580">
  <data key="d3">The option to change the payment method (fact_sentence_2) enables adjustments to when premiums are due, which directly affects the scheduling described in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">influences</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="a88904d4-aa6d-4deb-9bf5-50550bbc075d">
  <data key="d3">Choosing a new method of payment typically requires compatibility with existing payment frequencies; thus, modifying the method depends on whether it supports desired intervals like monthly or annual cycles.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="7dd274eb-79fa-4549-9a30-e662efe45594">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner has the right to alter how premiums are paid, but any modification requires submitting a written notification to the insurance company to be processed.</data>
  <data key="d4">requires notice</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="c8766159-f2f1-4980-a4f4-30a5ac151e22">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner has the right to propose altering the premium payment method, but the proposed change cannot take effect until it is formally approved by the insurer.</data>
  <data key="d4">requires approval</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="b160aaee-2bb3-42d4-99f1-e1274612ebc3">
  <data key="d3">Changing the premium payment method may help avoid policy lapse, thereby preventing termination of coverage without value. However, it does not guarantee continued coverage if other conditions aren't met.</data>
  <data key="d4">prevents lapsing</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="18dba2f2-8e4f-4bcc-9c25-79f3830d6409">
  <data key="d3">Changing the premium payment method affects when payments are due, potentially influencing whether the premium is paid before the grace period ends. Thus, altering the method could impact the likelihood of falling into default.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="defb9349-5ec2-419c-99cf-a721b93806df">
  <data key="d3">Changing the premium payment method ensures continuous policy coverage, which is a prerequisite for the insurer to fulfill its obligation to pay the death benefit upon verified death.</data>
  <data key="d4">preconditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d">
  <data key="d3">Changing the premium payment method requires formal processing, during which the insurer may demand extra documents to verify eligibility or compliance.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2" target="5e097a82-f754-43e4-905d-5d147b217df4">
  <data key="d3">Changing the premium payment method may necessitate submitting additional documentation, depending on the insurer’s reasonable requirements.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="41da1d70-0b28-4382-8c00-913229c760ba" target="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">requests change in payment method for</data>
</edge>
<edge source="894ad489-aeee-4a40-80da-55fe5e5fb864" target="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">has payment method subject to change by</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bb81706e-ebc8-4ec9-a8b7-f0387bfcb828" target="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">determines when the new payment method begins</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ce179d6f-9d6b-4e4a-99b9-58de296e48b2" target="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">may be affected by timing of payment method change</data>
</edge>
<edge source="98962a5a-846f-4c70-89eb-5228ab922761" target="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">could be triggered if new payment method fails to cover premiums</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7dd274eb-79fa-4549-9a30-e662efe45594" target="7cefaf5c-d57a-4619-80d7-15efb0cf9250">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">organization</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7dd274eb-79fa-4549-9a30-e662efe45594" target="b9d6004c-eb08-4eb2-979a-0b52af3a3149">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">person</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7dd274eb-79fa-4549-9a30-e662efe45594" target="c81e32dd-d72c-4d82-a77b-f08a11a09c1b">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">person</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7dd274eb-79fa-4549-9a30-e662efe45594" target="d8448440-412d-4819-9f91-30017637e369">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">person</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7dd274eb-79fa-4549-9a30-e662efe45594" target="d3afc654-609d-483a-be19-c0a473ef544e">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7dd274eb-79fa-4549-9a30-e662efe45594" target="dc190a06-d94b-4c8a-8227-eb8a2f230d55">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">date</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7dd274eb-79fa-4549-9a30-e662efe45594" target="cd95ad75-e009-4472-885f-20c5a8ba73a6">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
