  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 indicates that missing the grace period deadline results in policy lapse, reinforcing fact_sentence_1’s claim that coverage ends when the premium isn’t paid on time; thus, the two facts mutually support one another regarding policy consequences.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
