  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">person</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b" target="7d198572-7d5e-4bd9-ad5b-5536ce22a28a">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">person</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b" target="76f73865-99e1-4b65-8d29-781bc187b361">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">person</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b" target="388774b1-3d3f-41d6-a1e9-332274d7e170">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b" target="3f26e9b9-a417-476b-b467-66a273bb860f">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">date</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b" target="bf83087f-1812-46ee-a615-988e9e01b970">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b" target="60f837c4-7956-42f6-811f-ac8b2f04ee44">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b" target="77e05567-910f-4ab5-b8cf-d06387c2675e">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b" target="5788742f-dd25-4ae3-83ea-5d09f802a9a7">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b" target="8fed7975-8650-4a48-bf96-6c281cdfaaa1">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">document</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b" target="fb72e3f0-f7b4-42f1-8874-ebac56171d8b">
  <data key="d3">An Automatic Premium Loan ensures that unpaid premiums are covered during the grace period, preventing policy lapse and thus preserving the option to reinstate the policy within five years.</data>
  <data key="d4">prevents lapse</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b" target="e6dc59e3-a8f4-4f56-940d-46199cdc1c83">
  <data key="d3">An Automatic Premium Loan prevents policy lapse by covering missed premiums, thereby eliminating the need for reinstatement and its associated requirements like paying backlogged premiums with interest.</data>
  <data key="d4">prevents lapsing</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b" target="18dba2f2-8e4f-4bcc-9c25-79f3830d6409">
  <data key="d3">An Automatic Premium Loan ensures unpaid premiums are settled from the policy’s cash value when the grace period ends, thereby preventing the policy from lapsing despite non-payment.</data>
  <data key="d4">prevents</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b" target="b160aaee-2bb3-42d4-99f1-e1274612ebc3">
  <data key="d3">The existence of an Automatic Premium Loan ensures continued coverage beyond the grace period, thus preventing the policy from terminating without value when premiums are not paid.</data>
  <data key="d4">avoids termination</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b" target="2355dc3f-af2e-4eda-b96d-fd3204fa6b8e">
  <data key="d3">An automatic premium loan prevents policy lapse and thus avoids coverage termination without value, serving as a safeguard against the condition outlined in the first statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">prevents</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b" target="2d6cd2a6-4a3a-44fe-aa4e-912059d4a996">
  <data key="d3">Had the policy included an Automatic Premium Loan, it would have allowed unpaid premiums to be settled automatically; however, its exclusion makes this possibility irrelevant.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b" target="cf255e83-6bf3-43a7-a0f5-ffa85d8f1f6d">
  <data key="d3">Without adding the Automatic Premium Loan provision via rider, the policy cannot trigger automatic payments for overdue premiums, meaning the policyholder must manually address delinquency to avoid lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b" target="0e6c34e9-34ee-4684-a4db-b8f932cd319e">
  <data key="d3">The automatic payment of unpaid premiums via policy loan relies on having enough accumulated loan value; without it, the system cannot execute the loan even if the feature is enabled.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional dependency</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b" target="defb9349-5ec2-419c-99cf-a721b93806df">
  <data key="d3">An automatic premium loan covers unpaid premiums post-grace period, maintaining policy validity. This ensures that the policy remains active, enabling the potential future payment of the death benefit upon the insured's passing.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional dependency</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b" target="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e">
  <data key="d3">When an Automatic Premium Loan is active, unpaid premiums after the grace period are covered by a loan; however, interest on such loans is mandated by law.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a5cd9cd6-1db9-427a-9324-ca6bb84dca8b" target="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">provides</data>
</edge>
