<edge source="401085bd-ec9b-4194-a332-d312acf2f556" target="827c6995-f0dd-4669-b3cd-e64364930b24">
  <data key="d3">The death benefit is transferred to the beneficiary only after the insurer receives proper documentation verifying the insured’s death. This ensures accountability before disbursement.</data>
