<edge source="401085bd-ec9b-4194-a332-d312acf2f556" target="db12acf6-7ef1-442a-a0b0-0ebe2981d3c4">
  <data key="d3">The death benefit is distributed to the individual or organization formally identified as the beneficiary in the insurance application, ensuring proper disbursement upon claim.</data>
