  <data key="d3">The death benefit is only available if the policy remains active, which depends on premiums being paid in advance as required; thus, adherence to payment schedules enables fulfillment of the death benefit terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
