  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b9f4573a-344d-4bda-a387-f3c32ffcf8c5" target="defb9349-5ec2-419c-99cf-a721b93806df">
  <data key="d3">While the insurer agrees to pay the death benefit when proof of death is submitted, the actual disbursement hinges on whether the claim complies with the policy’s defined terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
