  <data key="d3">The requirement for acceptable proof of death ensures compliance with the policy terms governing the death benefit payment. Without documented evidence, the payment cannot proceed despite being subject to those terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
