  <data key="d3">The death benefit payout timeline and process depend on fulfilling the policy’s requirements, including providing acceptable proof of death. This ensures compliance with contractual obligations before disbursement.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b9f4573a-344d-4bda-a387-f3c32ffcf8c5" target="db12acf6-7ef1-442a-a0b0-0ebe2981d3c4">
  <data key="d3">The death benefit is distributed according to the policy’s conditions, including the designated recipient identified in the application. Without a properly named beneficiary, the payout process cannot proceed as intended.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
