  <data key="d3">Proof of death via a certified death certificate enables the fulfillment of the insurer’s commitment to disburse the death benefit, making it a critical prerequisite for activating the obligation stated in the contract.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables payout</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
