  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e097a82-f754-43e4-905d-5d147b217df4" target="b9f4573a-344d-4bda-a387-f3c32ffcf8c5">
  <data key="d3">Documentation requirements exist to ensure eligibility for the death benefit, aligning with the policy’s governing terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e097a82-f754-43e4-905d-5d147b217df4" target="e7ae6851-fbec-41a1-96fb-55af6ecf7ebc">
  <data key="d3">The need for extra documentation arises because the company retains control over approving alternative settlement options, ensuring compliance with internal standards.</data>
  <data key="d4">justifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e097a82-f754-43e4-905d-5d147b217df4" target="c8957594-3af6-486f-91f2-abe9eabc42e5">
  <data key="d3">The reasonableness of the documentation requested by the company forms the foundation for determining whether the submitted proof satisfies the requirement outlined in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">derives from</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e097a82-f754-43e4-905d-5d147b217df4" target="e15e7155-24f9-4078-bb5f-26d32c0baa61">
  <data key="d3">While fact_sentence_2 introduces flexibility for extra documentation, it relies on the existence of at least one mandatory document—such as the certified death certificate mentioned in fact_sentence_1—as part of the overall claim process.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e097a82-f754-43e4-905d-5d147b217df4" target="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d">
  <data key="d3">The Company’s right to request additional documentation is grounded in its ability to act reasonably; thus, the condition in fact_sentence_2 defines the scope and legitimacy of the action described in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e097a82-f754-43e4-905d-5d147b217df4" target="827c6995-f0dd-4669-b3cd-e64364930b24">
  <data key="d3">The Company has discretion over required documents, ensuring it receives sufficient evidence before disbursing benefits. This enables timely payment only after meeting its documented verification standards.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
