<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="defb9349-5ec2-419c-99cf-a721b93806df">
  <data key="d3">The calculation of interest beginning at the time of death assumes the prior condition—that the death has been verified and the policy remains in force—which enables the claim settlement process.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="401085bd-ec9b-4194-a332-d312acf2f556">
  <data key="d3">Accrued interest on the death benefit implies that the amount paid to the beneficiary exceeds the base death benefit, making timely processing essential post-death.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="b9f4573a-344d-4bda-a387-f3c32ffcf8c5">
  <data key="d3">If interest accrues on the Death Benefit from the date of death onward, it implies the benefit is recognized and payable under the policy’s rules, reinforcing that its disbursement is conditional upon meeting stated terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">implies term</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="2030c442-4fb0-495a-995b-bc3c20a392ff">
  <data key="d3">Since interest accrues from the date of death until payment, it implies the death benefit is disbursed as a lump sum unless otherwise arranged.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="c8957594-3af6-486f-91f2-abe9eabc42e5">
  <data key="d3">Accrued interest on the death benefit starts at the time of death, but only applies once official proof of death has been accepted by the insurer.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="e15e7155-24f9-4078-bb5f-26d32c0baa61">
  <data key="d3">Accrued interest begins at the time of death only after official proof like a certified death certificate has been submitted and verified, ensuring that payments reflect correct timelines tied to documented events.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d">
  <data key="d3">Accrued interest on the death benefit begins at the time of death and continues until payout, influencing the final amount disbursed after documentation has been verified.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="827c6995-f0dd-4669-b3cd-e64364930b24">
  <data key="d3">Interest begins accruing from the date of death onward; its calculation depends on when the death benefit is actually paid, which happens only after proper documentation is submitted.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e">
  <data key="d3">The accumulation of interest on the death benefit post-death is justified by statutory requirements mandating interest payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">justified by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="db12acf6-7ef1-442a-a0b0-0ebe2981d3c4">
  <data key="d3">Interest accrual begins upon the insured’s death and continues until payment, but only applies once the rightful beneficiary has been identified and verified.</data>
  <data key="d4">precondition</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
