</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="fb72e3f0-f7b4-42f1-8874-ebac56171d8b">
  <data key="d3">The legal mandate requiring interest ensures that when a policyholder seeks to reinstate a lapsed policy, they must account for accrued interest, which is part of the reinstatement condition.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="e6dc59e3-a8f4-4f56-940d-46199cdc1c83">
  <data key="d3">The legal mandate requiring interest ensures that when reinstating a lapsed policy, insurers collect accrued financial compensation, making it a necessary component of the reinstatement process.</data>
  <data key="d4">required by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="afe75990-53e6-4092-8595-3ddaed9d18bc">
  <data key="d3">Since interest on unpaid premiums is required by law, the insurance company has the legal right to determine its amount upon reinstatement, ensuring compliance with regulatory standards.</data>
  <data key="d4">enforces</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="f501fcfb-9924-4880-8895-de800216cc6b">
  <data key="d3">Applicable law requiring interest ensures that any outstanding amounts, including the first premium, accumulate interest over time if not paid promptly.</data>
  <data key="d4">applies to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b">
  <data key="d3">The legal requirement for interest ensures that any automatic premium loan used to cover delinquent payments incurs cost, reinforcing financial accountability.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="0e6c34e9-34ee-4684-a4db-b8f932cd319e">
  <data key="d3">The legal requirement for interest ensures that any outstanding balance from a policy loan used to cover unpaid premiums accumulates cost over time, affecting repayment terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">applies to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439">
  <data key="d3">Legal mandates requiring interest ensure that accrued interest on the death benefit is appropriately compensated upon payout.</data>
  <data key="d4">mandates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3df635eb-e9b5-4baa-b254-cf6053294726" target="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">has legal interest</data>
</edge>
