<edge source="db12acf6-7ef1-442a-a0b0-0ebe2981d3c4" target="defb9349-5ec2-419c-99cf-a721b93806df">
  <data key="d3">The beneficiary, defined as the party named in the application, is entitled to receive the death benefit once the insurer verifies the insured's death occurred during active policy coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">recipient of</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="db12acf6-7ef1-442a-a0b0-0ebe2981d3c4" target="401085bd-ec9b-4194-a332-d312acf2f556">
  <data key="d3">The designation of the beneficiary determines who is entitled to receive the death benefit when the insured passes away under active coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">defines</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="db12acf6-7ef1-442a-a0b0-0ebe2981d3c4" target="b9f4573a-344d-4bda-a387-f3c32ffcf8c5">
  <data key="d3">The individual or organization named as beneficiary in the application becomes entitled to receive the death benefit upon the insured’s passing, assuming all claim requirements are met.</data>
  <data key="d4">entitles to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="db12acf6-7ef1-442a-a0b0-0ebe2981d3c4" target="e15e7155-24f9-4078-bb5f-26d32c0baa61">
  <data key="d3">The beneficiary is legally entitled to receive the death benefit upon proving the insured’s death through official documents such as a certified death certificate.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="db12acf6-7ef1-442a-a0b0-0ebe2981d3c4" target="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439">
  <data key="d3">The beneficiary must be clearly designated before the death benefit—including accrued interest—is eligible for distribution.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="db12acf6-7ef1-442a-a0b0-0ebe2981d3c4" target="adfc5e3f-7b76-4e27-9e64-1e3c4108cc29">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes the baseline definition of the beneficiary from the original application, but fact_sentence_2 supersedes it by specifying that the most up-to-date formal designation takes precedence.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
