  <data key="d3">Sentence 2 sets the activation timeline for beneficiary changes, which could influence whether the designated individual qualifies under the conditions outlined in Sentence 1 regarding surviving beneficiaries.</data>
  <data key="d4">timing influence</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
