  <data key="d3">The second statement specifies that beneficiary changes take immediate effect upon signing, reinforcing the power vested in the owner; thus, the default assignment of ownership ensures someone legally capable exists to execute these changes.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
