  <data key="d3">Beneficiary changes take immediate effect upon receipt by the insurer, ensuring that the designated recipient at time of death—including potentially the policy owner—is correctly determined, aligning with the rule stated in fact_sentence_1 about distribution when no other beneficiary survives.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
