  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 establishes that a beneficiary change is effective irrespective of the insured’s life status. Fact sentence 2 adds specificity by stating the change occurs from the moment the request is signed, reinforcing the immediacy of the effect described in sentence 1.</data>
