  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 clarifies that beneficiary changes become effective immediately upon receipt by the insurer, reinforcing the importance of proper submission procedures emphasized in fact_sentence_1. Together, they ensure accountability and enforceability of administrative actions under the policy terms.</data>
