<edge source="376c30b4-9340-49c7-86af-f148910aff82" target="40cbb338-dde2-44ee-9830-c0c26916330c">
  <data key="d3">While the policy owner can initiate an assignment, the company reserves the right not to validate its legality, meaning the enforceability of the assignment rests outside the company’s control.</data>
  <data key="d4">limits right</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="376c30b4-9340-49c7-86af-f148910aff82" target="89ec8af1-a187-47d1-be96-dd8563e25f71">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 states the company disclaims liability for the legal validity of an assignment, while fact sentence 2 extends this by noting the company also avoids responsibility for associated tax outcomes. Together, they reinforce the policyholder’s full burden in managing assignments.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="376c30b4-9340-49c7-86af-f148910aff82" target="f292fa61-3d93-4115-9af6-3725ae88913a">
  <data key="d3">Since the company does not guarantee the validity of assignments, any assigned rights—including those of the owner and beneficiary—are bound by the conditions set forth in the assignment itself.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4f79d5d4-a528-4009-b4b8-84fab56d7e74" target="376c30b4-9340-49c7-86af-f148910aff82">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">may initiate assignment without company validation</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3f48279b-4869-42c8-831c-32861929553d" target="376c30b4-9340-49c7-86af-f148910aff82">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">potential receiver of assignment outcome under uncertain validity</data>
</edge>
