<edge source="2ff34d5f-b479-4e87-94c4-d2a540372601" target="f292fa61-3d93-4115-9af6-3725ae88913a">
  <data key="d3">Cancellation results in cessation of all benefits, making any previously assigned rights ineffective, even if such rights were defined under an assignment agreement.</data>
  <data key="d4">implied by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2ff34d5f-b479-4e87-94c4-d2a540372601" target="f36a1664-7f6f-4d19-a228-86f3f28f271d">
  <data key="d3">The inability to receive further benefits arises directly from the policy owner’s decision to cancel the policy, demonstrating a direct outcome of that action.</data>
  <data key="d4">result of</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2ff34d5f-b479-4e87-94c4-d2a540372601" target="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd">
  <data key="d3">No further benefits being payable after cancellation implies that the policy has been terminated, meaning coverage ceases at that point.</data>
  <data key="d4">result of</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2ff34d5f-b479-4e87-94c4-d2a540372601" target="1241bca4-a181-4a4e-9fe3-1834756b497c">
  <data key="d3">Cancellation results in termination of benefits, triggering a legal obligation to refund unearned premiums according to applicable regulations.</data>
  <data key="d4">result of</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
