<edge source="1241bca4-a181-4a4e-9fe3-1834756b497c" target="8173134a-e29e-4aa3-9deb-7944def59471">
  <data key="d3">Refunds of unearned premiums occur according to applicable law, which similarly governs when interest begins accruing from the date of death.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1241bca4-a181-4a4e-9fe3-1834756b497c" target="f36a1664-7f6f-4d19-a228-86f3f28f271d">
  <data key="d3">The possibility of receiving a refund for unearned premiums depends on the policy being canceled by the owner through a formal written request.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1241bca4-a181-4a4e-9fe3-1834756b497c" target="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd">
  <data key="d3">Unearned premium refunds depend on the policy being cancelled, which results in the termination of coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">result of</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1241bca4-a181-4a4e-9fe3-1834756b497c" target="2ff34d5f-b479-4e87-94c4-d2a540372601">
  <data key="d3">The potential for premium refunds depends on whether the policy was cancelled, which directly affects benefit eligibility.</data>
  <data key="d4">condition for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1241bca4-a181-4a4e-9fe3-1834756b497c" target="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36">
  <data key="d3">Access to premium payment history allows the policy owner to verify if unearned premiums exist, supporting claims about possible refunds based on actual paid amounts and timing.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
