  <data key="d3">Knowing the premium payment history helps determine eligibility and amount for unearned premium refunds as required by law.</data>
  <data key="d4">informs</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36" target="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 involves retrieving historical premium payments, which supports transparency and verification; having access to the complete policy document (as per fact sentence 1) ensures context for interpreting those payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36" target="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner has the right to obtain premium payment history, and the company is obligated to supply this data in a timely manner.</data>
  <data key="d4">responds to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36" target="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner has the right to obtain premium payment history, and the company is obligated to supply this data when requested, complying with relevant laws.</data>
  <data key="d4">fulfills</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36" target="9a4ee5a5-54a6-4cfd-82d7-4f61d67a4610">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 states the Policy Owner can obtain historical premium data, while fact sentence 2 indicates they can retrieve details about designated beneficiaries. Both pertain to access rights over different aspects of policy administration.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36" target="70b7c267-94b3-4ca2-8b53-0f47120d88f4">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 involves the Policy Owner’s right to obtain financial transaction data from the policy, while fact sentence 2 extends this access to contractual additions like riders. Together, they reflect comprehensive transparency rights over different types of policy documents.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36" target="67ea902a-000e-45d2-99dd-8a832a20afc4">
  <data key="d3">Access to premium payment history enhances the legitimacy and oversight of beneficiary changes made by the policy owner.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36" target="4f290f5d-0af6-4495-b93a-b82ca8a810cd">
  <data key="d3">Access to premium payment history aids the owner in managing assignment decisions, ensuring accurate assessment of the policy’s current status prior to transferring ownership.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables assignment</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36" target="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d">
  <data key="d3">Access to premium payment history aids the Policy Owner in evaluating whether to exercise their right to cancel the policy based on past contributions.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36" target="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b">
  <data key="d3">Access to premium payment history complements the examination right by providing concrete financial documentation necessary for verifying compliance and understanding policy performance during the review period.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhances</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
