  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">rider</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="1c097ac1-210c-471f-87e7-62f4f7ca9887">
  <data key="d3">Upon submission of a written request to change a beneficiary, the company commits to timely response by delivering required information, ensuring transparency in the modification process.</data>
  <data key="d4">triggers response</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="4ec4c4a4-c570-4478-be1c-c95a2d28b386">
  <data key="d3">After the policy owner submits a written request to change a beneficiary, the company agrees to deliver the required information within a reasonable period.</data>
  <data key="d4">triggers response</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7">
  <data key="d3">The company agrees to supply policy copies within a reasonable period when requested by the policy owner.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows from</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36">
  <data key="d3">The company commits to providing premium payment history within a reasonable timeframe when requested by the policy owner.</data>
  <data key="d4">obligates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="9a4ee5a5-54a6-4cfd-82d7-4f61d67a4610">
  <data key="d3">The insurer's commitment to deliver requested beneficiary information depends on the policy owner exercising their right to make such requests.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="70b7c267-94b3-4ca2-8b53-0f47120d88f4">
  <data key="d3">Upon the policy owner requesting riders or endorsements, the company agrees to supply the required details within a reasonable timeframe, fulfilling its duty in response to the owner’s right.</data>
  <data key="d4">triggers response</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes a general expectation for timely delivery of information, while fact_sentence_2 specifies that this obligation must align with applicable laws and regulations, ensuring legal compliance underpins the timeline.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
