</edge>
<edge source="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59" target="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7">
  <data key="d3">The company provides policy copies when requested because the policy owner holds a legitimate right to access their own policy documentation.</data>
  <data key="d4">responds to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59" target="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36">
  <data key="d3">The company commits to providing premium payment history upon request, fulfilling the policy owner’s established right to access such information.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59" target="9a4ee5a5-54a6-4cfd-82d7-4f61d67a4610">
  <data key="d3">The company fulfills its regulatory duty by supplying requested beneficiary information, enabling the policy owner to act on their designated rights.</data>
  <data key="d4">responds to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59" target="70b7c267-94b3-4ca2-8b53-0f47120d88f4">
  <data key="d3">The company’s duty to supply rider-related information arises directly from the policy owner’s right to request such additions or modifications to the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59" target="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 imposes a legal framework on the provision of information, reinforcing that even though the response should occur "within a reasonable time," this standard is subject to statutory and regulatory constraints outlined in law.</data>
  <data key="d4">qualifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
