  <data key="d3">Changes to settlement options require adherence to existing terms, which may include eligibility tied to rider availability; thus, requesting eligible riders could enable future changes.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="911c8355-e674-438d-8970-674b61225d1c" target="558f6754-63ec-4df4-bcd2-35ea7c37ab09">
  <data key="d3">The availability of settlement options limits the choices the policy owner can make regarding how the death benefit is distributed, ensuring compliance with predefined plan structures.</data>
