  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company issues policies that may include the Accelerated Death Benefit Rider, enabling early access to part of the death benefit under specific conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">issuer of</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
