  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company issues the policy, establishing its role as the authoritative body responsible for evaluating claims. This makes it relevant that any medical documentation required must meet standards set by the same company.</data>
  <data key="d4">institutional context</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
