  <data key="d3">The Sentinel Life Assurance Company issues policies that include an accelerated death benefit rider subject to specific exclusions, including cases where the terminal illness stems from self-inflicted injury.</data>
  <data key="d4">applies to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
