  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">document</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5" target="094a0acd-dfdf-4d78-ac8f-9b26d358714d">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5" target="87e9f89a-65f9-4c66-a900-8cbd7bde4d9f">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">exclusion</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5" target="dffed476-d7cc-47f6-acb8-fbc1733b95b0">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">exclusion</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5" target="511c9db5-1527-4166-a152-4f89c32a5b41">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">exclusion</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5" target="eae907fb-152c-46f1-958c-f87799ff1b19">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">right</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5" target="8d2a90e5-190a-475a-b4da-cbf1a50d73fd">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">legal notice</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5" target="868545fb-b90c-4d86-aa47-b3fa5811f814">
  <data key="d3">A written notice to the company is required to revoke a request made under the Accelerated Death Benefit Rider, which is itself an optional rider offered by the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">required by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5" target="e7abe25a-548e-4854-99a9-005d2c7abd86">
  <data key="d3">A revocable request for accelerated benefits implies that such payments are optional and subject to withdrawal at any time before disbursement.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5" target="bb127988-dd0c-41ea-98d9-d68d41d35ba5">
  <data key="d3">A formal withdrawal of a benefit request requires documented communication to the company. This action is only relevant once the individual has qualified under the terms of the rider, such as being diagnosed with a terminal illness.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows from</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5" target="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f">
  <data key="d3">Before any benefits are paid, a policyholder may withdraw their application by providing written notice to the company, ensuring they retain control over the decision until disbursement occurs. This revocation capability depends on having previously submitted a written request.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5" target="221c721d-0cca-43e4-9fde-c98c985d9e46">
  <data key="d3">If a policyholder wishes to cancel an earlier request for accelerated benefits, they must submit written notice to the company. This revocation is only effective once the initial request has been made and documented with required medical evidence.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5" target="c24c3db2-61fe-4fe8-b84c-a66c833de08e">
  <data key="d3">A policyholder may revoke a request for an accelerated benefit by submitting written notice to the company. Such revocation prevents the associated reduction in the death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5" target="cf34ad84-8215-4856-9bd3-153061d00093">
  <data key="d3">Written notice to the company is necessary to execute the revocation of an accelerated benefit request. Without such notice, the revocation cannot take effect.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f6d4d4e7-b7d7-401c-a523-17b43a82b42a" target="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">is recipient of</data>
</edge>
<edge source="97359209-645b-40e3-bf7e-1c856797e7bb" target="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">submits</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e4ed6624-2063-40e5-9745-8315dff93e0c" target="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">subject to revocation</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ba950c41-7a64-45e0-a645-90bc87477a8d" target="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">requires revocation via</data>
</edge>
<edge source="359a4d6a-c617-40d8-853e-34a854edf220" target="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">location of company receiving request</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a0a776b0-38b2-490a-9d2f-c18a9ea60c43" target="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5">
