  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 confirms Eleanor B. Raynor's leadership position at Sentinel Life Assurance Company, providing foundational legitimacy to her inclusion in fact_sentence_2, which alleges fraudulent conduct under her supervision.</data>
